    D["Cyber Essentials<br/>verified self-assessment<br/>Board declaration, assessor marks answers"]
    E["Within 3 months of the basic<br/>certificate (verify current rule)<br/>Cyber Essentials Plus<br/>Pre-scan and patch, external scan,<br/>sample device tests"]
    F["Months 2 to 9, in parallel<br/>Build the ISMS<br/>Risk assessment, treatment plan,<br/>Statement of Applicability, policies"]
    G["Months 8 to 10<br/>Internal audit and<br/>management review"]
    H["Months 10 to 12<br/>ISO certification audit<br/>Stage 1 then Stage 2"]
    I["Every year<br/>Renew Cyber Essentials and Plus<br/>ISO surveillance audit<br/>Three year ISO cycle"]
    A --> B --> C --> D --> E
    B --> F --> G --> H
    E --> I
